Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Both claims freshly reached `#Top`, but an unsound proof-only `split()` bridge skips a real heap allocation. For valid input `"o"`, fixed semantics ends at `heapLoc = 2`, while the proof claims `heapLoc = 1`. Removing the bridge makes the entry proof fail as expected.

Detailed report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Evidence: [bridge witness](/audit-output/evidence/stage4_bridge_witness.log), [proof reconstruction](/audit-output/evidence/stage3_reconstruction.log), [rule inventory](/audit-output/evidence/stage5_rule_inventory.tsv).
